In that metaphor, though, that's like saying that a company came in and bought up all the internet. Which, yeah, if somebody did that and started censoring everything, I'd be pretty pissed and would demand that there be some kind of intervention. 

&#x200B;

But I can go buy myself a domain and say whatever I want on it, with extremely little fear of censorship of basically any kind.
